1
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,426
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,866
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,940
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:37,586
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:40,026
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,946
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,920
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:49,066
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,400
Y...E...

10
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,719
Ye.

11
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:36,680
Zhan Xiang.

12
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:38,840
Go check

13
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:40,879
who received the payment for "Daybreak."

14
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:42,680
His payment info.

15
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,439
I want every detail.

16
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:52,480
=Quite The Girl=

17
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:52,860
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

18
00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:53,280
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

19
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,360
=Episode 11=

20
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:02,079
Xiuming, I checked.

21
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:04,480
The payment account is under Lu Mingye.

22
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:06,319
Lu Mingye?

23
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,439
Lu Mingyu.

24
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:13,639
Lu Mingye.

25
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,199
Ye.

26
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,960
You once told me Auntie Chen's daughter

27
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:20,080
is named Ye, right?

28
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,520
Yes, Ye.

29
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:39,319
At first, I thought

30
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,840
she was the Lu family's second daughter,

31
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:43,360
caged and wanting out.

32
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,960
So I was only seeing
the tip of the iceberg.

33
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,360
Mom...

34
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:54,080
I think I found Auntie Chen's daughter.

35
00:02:55,639 --> 00:02:56,960
(Duan Xiuming, open the door.)

36
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,080
(I'm Xu Suyue.)

37
00:02:58,639 --> 00:02:59,240
Um...

38
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:00,599
You wanna meet her?

39
00:03:00,719 --> 00:03:01,240
Yes.

40
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:03,120
She came at the right time.

41
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,400
I have something to ask her.

42
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:15,639
This can't be posted by Lu Mingyu.

43
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,360
She doesn't use her own account much,

44
00:03:17,599 --> 00:03:18,560
but she'd never post this.

45
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,879
Her family members
must've taken her phone.

46
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,520
Xiuming,

47
00:03:24,919 --> 00:03:26,360
the account you added isn't a burner.

48
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,759
The account you added

49
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,360
only has me and you as contacts.

50
00:03:29,439 --> 00:03:31,080
That's her real private account.

51
00:03:37,639 --> 00:03:38,319
Give her this.

52
00:03:40,199 --> 00:03:40,960
I can't see her.

53
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:46,120
Aren't you going to see her at school?

54
00:03:46,759 --> 00:03:47,479
School?

55
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,080
What school?

56
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,400
She got admitted
to Royal Imperial Academy of Arts.

57
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,759
She registered. Today's her first class.

58
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:56,479
Wait, aren't you her boyfriend?

59
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,680
You didn't even know that?

60
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,759
She didn't tell you at all?

61
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:01,360
Hey,

62
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,039
who says I didn't know?

63
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:04,319
Lu Mingyu,

64
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,319
her real name is Lu Mingye.

65
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:09,080
She's not even a Lu by blood.

66
00:04:09,719 --> 00:04:11,039
Her mother's surname is Chen, right?

67
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:13,360
About school...

68
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:14,879
I know too.

69
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:18,160
But she wanted it kept secret.

70
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,079
I'm not supposed to say.

71
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,680
She even told you

72
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,639
about Auntie Chen?

73
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:26,160
Guess she does have some feelings
for you.

74
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:27,560
I don't care about the rest.

75
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:28,839
Just tell me straight.

76
00:04:29,079 --> 00:04:30,600
Are you going to see her at school?

77
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:35,079
(So she really
is Auntie Chen's daughter.)

78
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:37,079
(Royal Imperial Academy of Arts...)

79
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,759
(So she pushed herself
to go abroad on time)

80
00:04:42,399 --> 00:04:43,920
(not to run away from me.)

81
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,759
(But I thought
she was cold and heartless.)

82
00:04:49,279 --> 00:04:50,680
Xiuming will definitely go.

83
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,279
You have no idea how much he loves her.

84
00:04:54,839 --> 00:04:55,399
Fine.

85
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:59,120
This is silicone scar gel.

86
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:00,040
Give it to her.

87
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,600
But I have a question.

88
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:03,920
Why ten boxes?

89
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,279
Stocking up?

90
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:09,519
That's for your young master

91
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:11,120
to figure out

92
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,519
why ten boxes.

93
00:05:16,079 --> 00:05:16,759
Zhan Xiang,

94
00:05:17,759 --> 00:05:20,160
book me the earliest flight to London.

95
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:21,319
I'll be right on it.

96
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:36,640
♪The day we met the breeze felt sweet♪

97
00:06:38,340 --> 00:06:44,066
♪You walked up smiling
like a movie scene♪

98
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,279
(She's drawing me.)

99
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,600
(Is she missing me?)

100
00:06:54,759 --> 00:06:56,600
(What happens to those who cross you?)

101
00:06:59,120 --> 00:06:59,920
(They die.)

102
00:07:00,839 --> 00:07:03,720
Become him... I will become him.

103
00:07:04,426 --> 00:07:04,906
(Tao Yalan)

104
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:13,726
♪With you, no place is far♪

105
00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:21,800
♪Now I know what longing is♪

106
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:28,906
♪From dawn to starlight with you♪

107
00:07:29,620 --> 00:07:35,800
♪You're all my joy, my every heartbeat♪

108
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:42,813
♪I want to grow old with you♪

109
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:51,400
♪Sharing one umbrella in the rain♪

110
00:07:52,020 --> 00:07:57,386
♪Every tomorrow, I want you to know♪

111
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:04,893
♪You're all my joy, all my pride♪

112
00:08:06,860 --> 00:08:12,480
♪Even the ordinary can shine so bright♪

113
00:08:14,700 --> 00:08:21,413
♪With you by my side♪

114
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:28,200
♪Every day is a gentle embrace♪

115
00:08:28,580 --> 00:08:33,933
♪You're all my joy, my every heartbeat♪

116
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,639
(For someone trapped in darkness,)

117
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:39,000
(who can't even have her own name,)

118
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,080
(love's a luxury)

119
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:43,559
(she can't afford.)

120
00:08:44,519 --> 00:08:45,360
(In your mind,)

121
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:47,240
(all you want is to win,)

122
00:08:48,399 --> 00:08:52,320
(even if you have to become me.)

123
00:08:52,386 --> 00:08:55,130
♪Every tomorrow, I want you to know♪

124
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,480
Do I miss him too much?

125
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,360
I'm even hallucinating.

126
00:09:04,759 --> 00:09:05,159
I...

127
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:11,013
♪Even the ordinary can shine so bright♪

128
00:09:13,740 --> 00:09:20,400
♪With you by my side♪

129
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:22,440
Miss Lu has injuries
on her limbs and back.

130
00:09:23,159 --> 00:09:24,360
Her limb injuries

131
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,480
are from chain friction.

132
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,720
And her back injuries

133
00:09:28,159 --> 00:09:28,799
are from whipping.

134
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:33,039
I believe she's suffered
long-term abuse.

135
00:09:33,399 --> 00:09:34,320
Or the skin on her limbs

136
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,600
wouldn't be this badly infected.

137
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,480
Also, her body is very weak.

138
00:09:38,679 --> 00:09:39,679
She needs attentive care

139
00:09:39,679 --> 00:09:41,559
to recover to a normal level.

140
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,279
Mr. Duan,

141
00:09:43,799 --> 00:09:44,600
I'll take my leave now.

142
00:09:58,039 --> 00:09:59,879
Does your family hit you often?

143
00:10:00,519 --> 00:10:01,600
How'd you know?

144
00:10:01,879 --> 00:10:03,600
You flinched just now.

145
00:10:03,919 --> 00:10:04,679
Punishment...

146
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:05,720
It's normal.

147
00:10:21,399 --> 00:10:22,200
Stay back.

148
00:10:25,519 --> 00:10:26,320
Lu Mingye.

149
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:27,879
Don't be afraid.

150
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,440
I'm Duan Xiuming.

151
00:10:47,799 --> 00:10:49,279
I won't leave you alone again.

152
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,799
I'm going to be late.

153
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:51,813
♪Maybe we met by chance♪

154
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:58,093
♪One glance, and I fell♪

155
00:12:00,140 --> 00:12:03,240
♪The moment we passed by♪

156
00:12:03,500 --> 00:12:06,386
♪My heartbeat lingered in my ear♪

157
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:11,586
♪Your face froze before my eyes♪

158
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:45,173
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

159
00:12:47,920 --> 00:12:51,493
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

160
00:12:54,880 --> 00:12:59,400
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

161
00:13:00,660 --> 00:13:05,560
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

162
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:14,400
♪A love letter written in song♪

163
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:19,653
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

164
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:28,266
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

165
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:34,613
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

166
00:13:35,500 --> 00:13:42,240
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

167
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:45,320
♪Close your eyes and count♪

168
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:50,020
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

169
00:13:50,020 --> 00:13:54,220
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
